  "text": "Normally, an infection needs genes to multiply. A virus has DNA or RNA. A bacterium has DNA. That was a basic rule of biology.",
  "dur": 6.82,
  "transition_in": "diamond",
  "prev": "",
  "nxt": "Yet here was an agent that seemed to break the rule.",
