  "text": "So how can a protein spread? Your brain naturally makes a protein called PrP. In its normal form, it folds into a healthy shape.",
  "dur": 7.4,
  "transition_in": "eye",
  "prev": "",
  "nxt": "A prion is the same protein, folded the wrong way. Think of a key that has been bent.",
  "frog_hint": true
 },
